- I did not re-walk the runtime-source citations in omlx.md/osaurus.md/vmlx.md/optiq.md as a whole (order: spot-check only); the spot-checks above are what I checked.
- Editing two `ohyesmlx/*.py` docstrings changes `measure._source_sha256()`, so future run headers will carry a sha distinct from those on disk. Existing records are unaffected; no runtime was started.

